    {
      "ruling_state": "R-89 at issue",
      "A_value": "NOT-IN-FORCE (derived)",
      "derivation": "from R-89's PREPARED marker plus R-86's rule 'Any future ruling issued by the ARB Chief remains PREPARED, NOT ADOPTED, until the Decision Authority acts on it' plus the precedent that a PREPARED ruling's effect does not hold",
