    {"id": "D8", "class": "evidence scope", "item": "support for R-82..R-85 PREPARED (A2)", "A": "treats 'these five' = R-81..R-85 as an inference from R-86's count", "reviewer": "a quote A did not use supports it further: R-86 grounds \"the rulings explicitly marked PREPARED rather than implicitly adopted\"", "verdict_impact": "none (strengthens A)"},
